WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.284
Multiples appear when you count by a number. The least common multiple is the first

00:00:05.284 --> 00:00:06.301
shared positive multiple.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:12.493
Find LCM(12, 6). The answer is 12. Least common multiple equals 12.

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:18.662
Two bells in a craft workshop ring every 8 and 5 minutes. After how many minutes will

00:00:18.662 --> 00:00:21.153
they ring together? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:27.736
Two bells in a craft workshop ring every 8 and 5 minutes. After how many minutes will

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:31.761
they ring together? The answer is 40. Least common multiple equals 40.
